course: dictionary
lesson: 11739
title: Old words and slang
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words are short and informal, like slang. «The old sailor filled his pipe with baccy and sat by the fire.» Baccy is short for tobacco, and the pipe tells you it is something people smoke.
explain: Baccy is a homely, old-fashioned word. You might hear it from old men, sailors or countryfolk in British stories, but people often use the full word tobacco in writing. «The shop sold tea, sweets and baccy.» Here baccy is one thing in a list of goods, so it is a noun.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. Ask yourself: what is it, what do people do with it, and who would say it? Then check your idea by putting it back into the sentence to see if it still makes sense.
fact: Baccy is short for tobacco.
fact: «Baccy» means dried leaves that people smoke in pipes and cigarettes.
fact: «Baccy» is informal and mostly used in Britain.
fact: Smoking tobacco causes serious illness, so it is never safe.
fact: «Baccy» is uncountable: say «some baccy», not «two baccys».
exercise: «The old sailor filled his pipe with baccy.» What is baccy? | A kind of sweet | A type of hat | A small wooden boat | *Dried leaves that people smoke in pipes and cigarettes
exercise: «The shop sold tea, sweets and baccy.» Which word is short for tobacco? | shop | *baccy | tea | sweets
exercise: Which sentence uses baccy correctly? | Grandad bought a baccies. | *Grandad bought some baccy. | Grandad bought three baccy. | Grandad bought two baccys.
test: «Baccy» is an informal word. What does informal mean here? | *It is everyday, relaxed talk rather than formal writing | It is a scientific name for a plant | It is a very formal word for a court | It is a type of boat
test: Why is it important to know that baccy is harmful? | Baccy makes you taller | Baccy is only sold in summer | Baccy is good for your chest | *Smoking tobacco causes serious illness
exam: The old man said, «Baccy is a bad habit.» What does baccy mean? | A fishing rod | *Dried tobacco leaves that people smoke | A bag of sweets | A kind of hat
